# Normalize every text file to LF in the working tree on all platforms.
#
# Not cosmetic. This repository's integrity model hashes file bytes:
# run-ledger WriteEvidence digests, the determinism ratchet, the packed-CLI
# smoke, and the preserved-evidence SHA-1 pinned over the live NaN orphan at
# .ngrace/changes/archive/C-TOKEN-INTEGRITY/run/NaN-T-001-opened.xml.
#
# A CRLF-converting checkout changes those bytes and therefore those digests —
# the orphan is 135 bytes / c0cc8899… as LF and 136 bytes / bab374c4… as CRLF.
# Pinning a digest over a committed file is only meaningful if every platform
# checks out the same bytes.
#
# No tracked file currently contains CRLF and no binary files are tracked, so
# this normalizes nothing that exists today; it fixes what a Windows checkout
# would otherwise produce.
* text=auto eol=lf
